  "description": "Born into a renowned shamanic lineage, Nam-joo attends the wedding of his first love, Seung-hyun, after eight long years... only to reunite with Seung-hyun's younger cousin, Seong-hwa. Having harbored an unrequited crush on Nam-joo for years, Seong-hwa realizes Nam-joo still lingers on feelings for Seung-hyun. Weaponizing his own facial resemblance to his cousin, Seong-hwa sleeps with him. As time passes, the two find themselves genuinely drawn to one another. Yet Nam-joo hides a fatal secret—the very reason why Seong-hwa must never fall in love with him... *(Source: Bomtoon, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/nottomorrow)",
